{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10640100","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10640100","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"narration:0:1064010001:1":{"text":"大釜の中で食材が激しく煮え立ち、奇妙な気配が中から立ち昇り始めた。","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:2::1":{"text":"混沌と虚空の暗黒召喚鍋","source_cn":"混沌虚空之黑暗召唤锅","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3C2E47365F671D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1064010002:2":{"text":"混沌と虚空の暗黒召喚鍋、完成じゃ。","source_cn":"混沌虚空之黑暗召唤锅，完成了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x2A576FCB712EDF1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1064010003:0":{"text":"……本当にこの見た目で成功なの？","source_cn":"……就这副模样，真的成功了吗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xAFF33BD259BD1FF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1064010004:0":{"text":"混沌系の魔物らしきものは見当たらないけど……","source_cn":"混沌类魔物好像并没有出现。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x941E0BF8B772C511","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064010005:1":{"text":"私たち、やっぱり帰れないんじゃ……","source_cn":"我们是不是回不去了……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xD0420620312E69CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1064010006:1":{"text":"それに、ライオスも二人のままだぞ。","source_cn":"而且还是有两个莱欧斯啊。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x140E444536790177","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1064010007:1":{"text":"それでは、ライオスの問題に戻ろう。","source_cn":"那我们就先解决莱欧斯的问题吧。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7AF49D3AD84B4D41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064010008:1":{"text":"ライオス、暗黒召喚鍋を食べてみるか？","source_cn":"莱欧斯，要不要尝尝混沌虚空之黑暗召唤锅？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7EE7BE0AFC57F59A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:11::2":{"text":"混沌と虚空の暗黒召喚鍋","source_cn":"混沌虚空之黑暗召唤锅","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3C2E47365F671D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1064010009:1":{"text":"もちろんだ！","source_cn":"当然要尝！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x13EB61B1E0D9C87B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064010010:1":{"text":"どんな味がするんだろうなあ。特別な効果があったりするのか？","source_cn":"不知道尝起来是什么味道？会有什么特殊效果吗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x48C07E6069D6C753","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1064010011:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1064010011":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1064010012:1":{"text":"こっちだな。本物なら、わしの作った料理を拒むはずがない。","source_cn":"后面过来的莱欧斯是真的，真正的莱欧斯不会拒绝老夫烹饪的料理。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x57CD5E067826B577","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1064010013:0":{"text":"俺達と一緒にいた方のライオスが偽物だったのか！","source_cn":"一直跟着我们的莱欧斯是假的！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF81C360860C4EEDF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1064010014:0":{"text":"みんな……本物が分かったのか！？","source_cn":"大家……竟然分出来了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x18CD4A69B1E3C50D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1064010015:0":{"text":"あなたは誰？まさか、本当に狂乱の魔術師の手先なの！？","source_cn":"你是谁？不会真的是狂乱魔法师派来的吧？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF41F76BD3A05A37C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1064010016:0":{"text":"あーはははははっ！ハッズレー！","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈哈哈，猜错了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4890D4B478533242","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1064010017:0":{"text":"やれやれ、誰も僕の正体を見破れないなんてねえ。僕は――","source_cn":"既然没人能猜出我的身份，我——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x11B59F7FB73C300E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:27:1064010017":{"text":"やれやれ、誰も僕の正体を見破れないなんてねえ。僕は――","source_cn":"既然没人能猜出我的身份，我——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x11B59F7FB73C300E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064010018:1":{"text":"偽ライオスの表情が一瞬固まったかと思うと、すぐに不気味な笑みを浮かべた。","source_cn":"假莱欧斯的表情瞬间凝固，随后露出一个诡异的笑容。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF8710B5F676FD29F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1064010019:0":{"text":"すると、その体がみるみる歪み始め、ベリルの姿が現れた。","source_cn":"他的身形开始扭曲和变化，最终化为了贝利尔的模样。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x8BD27D3C9D0B87EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1064010020:1":{"text":"やれやれ、やっぱり、同じネタは何度もやるものじゃないねえ。","source_cn":"哎呀呀，看来玩过一次的把戏不能再玩第二次了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xAC27F48B09B93D5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1064010021:1":{"text":"まったく、マーリンってば、相変わらず勘がいいんだから！","source_cn":"梅林，真讨厌！你还是这么敏锐！","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xEC17D6DC8523ADC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:34:1064010021":{"text":"まったく、マーリンってば、相変わらず勘がいいんだから！","source_cn":"梅林，真讨厌！你还是这么敏锐！","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xEC17D6DC8523ADC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1064010022:1":{"text":"ああ、誤解しないで。別に悪さをするつもりはないよぉ。","source_cn":"别误会，我可没带着什么邪恶目的前来。","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xCFBFA732211C4319","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1064010023:1":{"text":"どっかの誰かさんが、混沌系の魔物を召喚するって聞いたから、見物に来ただけさあ！","source_cn":"只是听说有人要召唤混沌类魔物，特意来看看热闹罢了！","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xF094F8ABCDB21D3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1064010024:1":{"text":"……俺に化けて、みんなを騙そうとしたくせに？","source_cn":"……但你假扮了我还试图混淆大家。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x0CB3BC8CDB6384F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1064010025:1":{"text":"それはそうと、ライオス。どうやってここまで来られたんだ？","source_cn":"不过莱欧斯，你怎么赶过来的？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x19E577E144B102A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1064010026:1":{"text":"ああ、変な双子と出会って、その二人に助けてもらったんだよ。","source_cn":"我遇到了一对奇怪的双胞胎，他们帮助了我。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xAD370588A5A87C8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1064010027:1":{"text":"エリアとライラだな！ったく、ちょっと異次元のお客さんに化けて遊ぼうとしただけじゃないか！","source_cn":"可恶的伊莱亚和莱拉！我只是想扮成异界来客找点乐子！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x138F94D4D0B25D4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1064010028:1":{"text":"どうして私たちが異次元から来たって知ってるの？","source_cn":"你怎么知道我们来自异界？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x215B8324A84ED54A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:45:1064010028":{"text":"どうして私たちが異次元から来たって知ってるの？","source_cn":"你怎么知道我们来自异界？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x215B8324A84ED54A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1064010029:1":{"text":"ちょっとぉ、ネタばらしが早すぎるよお！","source_cn":"什么嘛？这就揭穿了我的身份吗？","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x528F7911D0688DD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1064010030:1":{"text":"相手をじらす楽しみってものを知らない――","source_cn":"你真是一点都不懂得保留悬念的乐趣——","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x6A9D37FDF551275A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1064010031:1":{"text":"ベリルが言い終わらないうちに、突然、大釜から眩い光が迸った。","source_cn":"贝利尔的话还未说完，坩埚突然爆发出刺目的光芒。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7F703C434BE34AFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1064010032:1":{"text":"次の瞬間、空間が激しく歪み出し、ぼんやりとした巨大な影の姿が現れ始めた。","source_cn":"空间开始剧烈扭曲，一个巨大的模糊身影若隐若现。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x14C8BE4FAFA51F95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1064010033:1":{"text":"間違いない！私たちをエスペリアに連れてきた魔物よ！","source_cn":"是它！那个把我们带来伊索米亚的魔物——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF50FE4EBEF120868","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1064010034:1":{"text":"まさか本当に現れるなんて……！","source_cn":"竟然真的出现了？！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x574CB96AEA5D382B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:45:0:1":{"text":"こいつは時空を超えられるカタストロフなんだ。","source_cn":"他是恶魔","status":"matched_manual_luae_gender_pair","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"manual_luae_gender_pair_target_differs","male":"こいつは時空を超えられるカタストロフなんだ。","female":"こいつは時空を超えられるカタストロフなのよ。","variant_male_record_index":"luae","variant_female_record_index":"luae","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:34:0:1":{"text":"何のつもりだ？","source_cn":"你想干什么？<key:dialog64>","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x578DF6D3295940E2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"何のつもりだ？","female":"何のつもり？","variant_male_record_index":"60478","variant_female_record_index":"60479","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":